[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3840.309, "timestamp": "01:04:00", "text": "ですから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3843.19, "timestamp": "01:04:03", "text": "適切なトレーニングや指導ができる人がいれば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3847.19, "timestamp": "01:04:07", "text": "ビタミンシーンでは何が起こるか、これを教えてあげることができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3849.75, "timestamp": "01:04:09", "text": "。 それは大変助かります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3852.39, "timestamp": "01:04:12", "text": "。 何をすべきか分からずにその場に飛び込んで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3859.589, "timestamp": "01:04:19", "text": "広告とかで台無しにしないでください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3861.75, "timestamp": "01:04:21", "text": "ええ、そうですね、勇気を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3864.39, "timestamp": "01:04:24", "text": "持って行動することが大切です。 それが一番"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3867.67, "timestamp": "01:04:27", "text": "重要な点です。 恐れずに色々なことに挑戦し、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3870.069, "timestamp": "01:04:30", "text": "実験してみましょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3872.23, "timestamp": "01:04:32", "text": "ええ、それが私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3874.23, "timestamp": "01:04:34", "text": "提案です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3876.39, "timestamp": "01:04:36", "text": "頭の中に何かアイデアがあって、それを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3879.43, "timestamp": "01:04:39", "text": "実行したいという気持ちが湧いてきたら、ぜひやってみてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3881.589, "timestamp": "01:04:41", "text": "しかし、あなたの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3885.67, "timestamp": "01:04:45", "text": "会社や所属するタレントエージェンシーの出演者たちも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3888.069, "timestamp": "01:04:48", "text": "、人間であるということを理解しなければなりません。 だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3890.39, "timestamp": "01:04:50", "text": "彼らが"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3890.7, "timestamp": "01:04:50", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "okaay so we yolo solo bolo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3894.549, "timestamp": "01:04:54", "text": "これを行うための自由なスペースも確保できるようなものでなければならない。 右？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3895.472, "timestamp": "01:04:55", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/m8MfY4jbFsWJhL0PyouA2AkUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/ygF1XpGUMMjk8gSDrI2wCx"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3895.75, "timestamp": "01:04:55", "text": "企業向けストリーミングとなると、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3898.309, "timestamp": "01:04:58", "text": "もっと深刻な問題ですよね？"}]